From dba58f1ebe8e836f457ad3492d206c8a4f7946b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: build <build@localhost>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 09:22:13 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Enable Chrome extensions in the Android phone build

Compile upstream's desktop-android extensions runtime (enable_desktop_android_extensions)
into chrome_public_apk: widen gn/grd gates that were is_desktop_android-only, map the
IS_DESKTOP_ANDROID C++ sites to IS_ANDROID, register the color-change WebUI binder,
add the extensions toolbar stub to the phone toolbar, fall back to chrome://extensions
when there is no toolbar coordinator, give extension actions a fixed width budget on
phones, auto-reload killed background pages, allow off-store .crx installs from a tab
(permission prompt kept), enable ChromeNativeUrlOverriding.
